    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>i</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>200</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>199</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>)</mo></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></math>. Then,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;are roots of the equation.",
