  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>i</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>200</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>199</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>200</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>200</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>200</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>200</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>201</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>201</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>q</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>q</mi></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Required equation is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
